{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>BudgetGoal 是一款圍繞儲蓄目標而設的理財應用，適合想清楚掌握發薪日前可用金額、避免衝動消費的人士。它原價 US $4.99，現正推出終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，讓用戶以目標為本規劃日常開支。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-164.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>以目標規劃每日開支</h2>\n<p>用戶可先設定儲蓄目標，加入收入與支出，應用會計算發薪日前每日可安全花費的金額；購物前亦可查看該筆消費對目標的影響。介面提供視覺化進度、每日開支指引及主畫面小工具，讓理財計劃緊貼日常。全程毋須連結銀行或開設賬戶，財務資料只儲存在裝置本地。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-140-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-141-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-142-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-143-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-144-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-145-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>BudgetGoal: Budget Planner 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：BudgetGoal: Budget Planner</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/budgetgoal/id6762633939\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:03:50.575748+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":404,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:36:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T08:12:11.027674+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T09:57:17.982705+00:00","content_hash":"39285bd995e8a33feec112e502e8028aeb5505a2e934c11df5bfed7ef8cc0d51","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}